<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Frequency__c</fullName>
    <description
    >Visit frequency for the store-to-route assignment. Determines which calendar weeks the store is visited.</description>
    <inlineHelpText
    >Select the visit frequency for this store. Weekly allows multiple visit days. Fortnightly, Monthly and Bi monthly frequencies allow only 1 visit day. Bi monthly frequencies visit the store once every 8 weeks. Allow multiple active routing per store and route is allowed — overlapping date ranges on the same route will be blocked; the same customer may be on multiple routes. Changing to a frequency that allows only one visit day will clear extra visit days beyond the first.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Frequency</label>
